 "text": "Grain - Hoffman Ag Service, LTD\nSkip to content\n269-781-2245\nHoffmanag269@Gmail.com\nHome\nGrain\nSales\nServices\nCustomer Account Access\nHome\nGrain\nSales\nServices\nCustomer Account Access\nGrain\nGrain\nGrain\nGrain\nGrain\nGrain\nYour browser does not support iframes.\nOur grain storage has increased to over 1 million bushels. Our newest addition was a new corn intake system with an upgraded dump pit, faster grain elevator and a new grain dryer which allows for an increased intake of corn per hour, meaning customers will spend more time in fields than in line waiting to be dumped. We also offer grain trucking as well.\nQuick Links\nHome\nGrain\nSales\nServices\nCustomer Account Access\nHours of Operation\nMon-Friday 8am-5pm\nWeekends/Extended weekly hours – As needed throughout the planting, growing and harvest season. Call ahead or check our Facebook page for updated hours.\nContact\n+269-781-2245\nAddress: 21521 E Michigan Avenue Marshall, MI 49068\nHoffmanag269@Gmail.com\nFacebook\n© 2026 Hoffman AG Service. All Rights Reserved\nLearn more about local cash bids by visiting: “DTN (Bids)”",
